## Summary

The xAI response translators report `total_tokens` / `totalTokenCount` as 0 when upstream usage uses the legacy `prompt_tokens` / `completion_tokens` names. The parts already fall back to the legacy aliases — only the total doesn't, so bills and dashboards built on the total silently under-report.

Real runs:

```js
xaiCompletedToChatJson({ usage: { prompt_tokens: 10, completion_tokens: 5 } })
// usage: { prompt_tokens: 10, completion_tokens: 5, total_tokens: 0 }
xaiCompletedToGeminiJson({ usage: { prompt_tokens: 10, completion_tokens: 5 } })
// usageMetadata: { promptTokenCount: 10, candidatesTokenCount: 5, totalTokenCount: 0 }
```

## Relevant issues

Self-found while auditing the xAI translators; no existing issue covers the total fallback.

Follows #12294 (opened by @im-ecorp, same defect) with a production data set from 2026-09-03: smart/yano-free/yano-openweights returned **1419× 503 ALL_TARGETS_SKIPPED in one hour** with `diagnostics.attempted=0, excluded=[]`. Root causes visible only in debug logs:

1. an API-key `allowed_models` mismatch silently skipped the only healthy target (allowlist had an alias wildcard; the target's dynamic provider id never matched) — surfacing only as a generic "availability" skip;
2. a persisted-cooldown skip (with the reset timestamp) never recorded a decision-trace entry at all;
3. two combo targets pointed at a provider with zero connections — silent dead weight.

Also seen the same day: 68× `[502] quality validation — reasoning consumed 10/10 tokens — no content output` — tiny-budget reasoning probes (max_tokens < 256, e.g. capability pings) whose upstream 200 burned the entire budget on thinking get classified as provider faults, burning fallbacks and poisoning model lockouts, even though #10281 already answers the identical shape with a truncated 200 on the direct (non-combo) path.

## Fix (branch `combo-skip-diagnostics`)
- `decisionTrace.ts`: `persisted_cooldown` skip reason + entry `detail` + pure `summarizeSkippedTargets()`;
- both combo dispatchers: persisted-cooldown skips record a trace decision; `buildComboDiag()` emits `skippedTargets[]` + `nextRetryAt` (earliest cooldown reset) in the 503 body;
- `chat.ts`: API-key allowlist rejections during target screening log at info with the key name;
- tiny-budget probes → truncated 200 (`finish_reason: "length"`) in both dispatchers.

